{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4883b7dfffb02e36","name":"Exclusive","source":{"id":"source:reference-4883b7dfffb02e36","title":"Exclusive","revision":18156,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:40:52Z","sha256":"df916faf1474d45610e04578fdcfc5aa11ca790cc65883b61ed62ccc9d51266f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18156","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Exclusive&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4883b7dfffb02e36","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The cost of a Droid's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Locomotion System"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Locomotion_System"}," can be reduced by placing limitations on its use. An Exclusive Locomotion System costs only one-tenth the normal cost. The Droid must spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"}," to engage or disengage the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Locomotion System"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Locomotion_System"},". While the system is engaged, the Droid can only use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Run"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Run","referenceId":"reference:00d60e31a4e6b834"}," Actions.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
